what: BACKLOG deep-recursive-direct — inside a `direct` block, a call to
  the ENCLOSING def is coloured as `Free.delay(() => call).reflect`, so
  the article's `deepRecursive` needs no annotation here: fib/sum/isEven
  probed by hand 2026-09-15 already run at depth 10^6 on a 512 KB stack.
  Direct.scala only, plus TestDirect cases (fib, non-tail sum, mutual
  recursion, a self-call already under .reflect), specs/direct-macro.md.
